{"id":"n16551-9-2","stage":3,"title":"거칠다 · 尖锐","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16551-9-2-1","ko":"왜 발에 붕대를 감고 있어?","zh":"为什么脚上缠着绷带？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발에","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"붕대를","meaning":"绷带","explanation":"붕대：绷带；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"붕대","audio":"/audio/2669eb1054899a3c074b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61046","senseId":"1","lemma":"붕대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감고","meaning":"缠，绕，卷","explanation":"감다：缠，绕，卷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"감다","audio":"/audio/54ca4809ba266b0bc479.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16274","senseId":"1","lemma":"감다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"45a4bd47fdb2ffcd","term":"발","zh":"足，脚","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3","entryId":"67886","definition":"人或动物腿部的最末端部分。","pronunciation":["발"]},{"id":"2669eb1054899a3c","term":"붕대","zh":"绷带","audio":"/audio/2669eb1054899a3c074b.mp3","entryId":"61046","definition":"包扎伤患处用的消毒布条。","pronunciation":["붕대"]},{"id":"54ca4809ba266b0b","term":"감다","zh":"缠，绕，卷","audio":"/audio/54ca4809ba266b0bc479.mp3","entryId":"16274","definition":"把某个物体裹或围在别的物体上。","pronunciation":["감ː따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/53852edad839d6019e93.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16551-9-2-2","ko":"계곡에서 노는데 돌이 거칠어서 발을 다쳤어","zh":"在溪谷里玩的时候，因为石头太粗糙，脚受伤了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"계곡에서","meaning":"溪谷，山涧","explanation":"계곡：溪谷，山涧；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"계곡","audio":"/audio/c3f5d59dccc5ffe93501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25645","senseId":"1","lemma":"계곡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"노는데","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌이","meaning":"石，石头","explanation":"돌：石，石头；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돌","audio":"/audio/c7e6ac93ca8c5b84f5c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62589","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거칠어서","meaning":"尖锐","explanation":"거칠다：尖锐；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"거칠다","audio":"/audio/5827b9bfe1de17f4cb46.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16551","senseId":"9","lemma":"거칠다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발을","meaning":"足，脚","explanation":"발：足，脚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"발","audio":"/audio/45a4bd47fdb2ffcdd952.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67886","senseId":"1","lemma":"발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다쳤어","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3f